You are an expert in digital hardware design and post-quantum cryptography. Analyze the paper and extract ONLY one implementable innovation for modular multiplication or modular reduction.

## What to extract (ONLY this category)

**modular_arithmetic** — A novel modular multiplication or modular reduction algorithm for PQC hardware. Examples:
   - New modular reduction (K-Red, LUT-based, Barrett, Montgomery variants)
   - New modular multiplier designs (DSP+logic hybrid, optimized constant multiplication)
   - Any arithmetic optimization that reduces area/delay for modular operations

## What to SKIP (do NOT extract)

- Transform structures, memory architectures, ROMs, permutation networks, control FSMs, address generators, and scheduling strategies
- Encoding/decoding, serialization, I/O interfaces
- Standard Montgomery/Barrett reduction (unless the paper proposes a novel variation)
- Top-level system integration architectures

